0.10
----
* added FlexImageField/FlexImageInput, the canonical image field: its value is a `flexfile:<uuid>`
  reference to a payload the project stores, not the payload itself
* added hope_flex_fields.references with is_reference, parse_reference, format_reference,
  is_data_uri, flex_file_src and the DATA_URI_FORMAT/DATA_URI_PREFIX/DEFAULT_MIMETYPE constants
* added the FILE_URL_NAME configuration entry, the route flex_file_src builds payload URLs from
* deprecated Base64ImageField/Base64ImageInput, which inline the payload as a `data:` URI. They are
  kept for one release and are not registered by default: a project still migrating away from them
  registers them itself, so that swapping the field type and migrating the data can happen in
  either order
* added Pillow as a dependency: FlexImageField validates uploads through django.forms.ImageField, which needs it

